    "media:imagetext": "THE DOUBLE-DECKED \"STRATO\" CLIPPERS\nLargest, fastest, most luxurious of all airliners are\nPan American's Double-Decked \"Strato\" Clippers oper-\nating from New York to both Europe and South America.\nAnd from the U.S. westcoast to Hawaii, the Orient and\nSpecial, de luxe flights of these \"Strato\" Clippers are\n\"The President\" and \"The President Special\" to Europe\nand \"El Presidente\" connecting New York and Buenos\nAires. Veritable fying hotels,\" they afford full sleeping\naccommodations and the most\nluxurious service aloft.\nPan American's fleet of \"Strato\" Clippers is the largest\nin the worid!\nCopyright, 1951, Pan American World Airways, Inc. Printed in U.S.A.\nCLIPPER, TRADE•MARK REG. U.S. PAT, OFF.\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\n2022124.49-",
